"Content" means the natural-language substance of this data model wherever it
appears, including inside TypeScript source files: the framework category and
requirement titles and descriptions (all languages), the per-requirement
guidance, the legal citations and article references, the cross-framework
satisfaction pairs together with their rationales and equivalence
classifications, and the mapping tables.

You are free to share, adapt, and use the content commercially, provided you
give appropriate credit. Suggested attribution:

