3. THIRD-PARTY STANDARDS
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

ISO/IEC 27001:2022 control identifiers and titles are referenced for mapping
purposes only. The text of the standard is not reproduced in this package and
remains the property of ISO/IEC. References to EU legal acts (NIS 2 Directive
(EU) 2022/2555, GDPR, CRA, the AI Act, CIR (EU) 2024/2690) and to the German
BSIG follow the official texts, which are themselves not subject to copyright
protection as legal acts.

